# The system menu (SUPER+ALT+Space, or /m in the launcher). One item per line:
#   group | title | description | command | glyph (optional, a Tabler icon name)
# A top-level item has an empty group. A group appears as soon as an item uses
# it; give it a description with a line whose title is empty.
# Commands run detached. Prefixes:
#   term:      run in a terminal and wait for a key before closing
#   menu:      a generated submenu (install, remove, theme, terminal, agent)
#   launcher:  switch the launcher to this search (e.g. "/keys ")
# Copy this file to ~/.config/@DISTRO_ID@/menu to change your own.

| Apps | Search and open apps | launcher: | apps

